        "body": {
          "size": 1609,
          "base64_url_content": null,
          "content": "<div style=\"font:16px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;color:#0e1a22;max-width:640px\"><p>The Momentum brand system and video library are ready for your review.</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NT7R80_I7l0L_FIVsoUUIQKD6C4Ogof-/view\">Watch or download Momentum-AI-Launch-Reel-16x9.mp4</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aP9W2GMRCWba_PL0G4Tjt0RQGjoVbEF2/view\">View the brand system PDF</a><br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1po121uPblmE-cCUoe3TV1DMUxpX0K2IV/view\">Download the interactive brand board and reusable assets</a></p><p>The brand kit includes the exact Momentum logo files, typography, color tokens, ten SVG icons, motion controls, editorial examples and component examples. Download and extract the ZIP, then open index.html to explore it.</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pDe5h4a9UloCV63A0bWfhErDeo4WcRLp\">Current video downloads</a> include the seven music cuts, reel and motion studies. The four previously blank square studies have been corrected and checked in part 6.</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MQ37H7IEov918u2vAhfASh2polen7lKR/view\">Artwork and editable collateral</a><br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NiAK6gUXV3hJJ0ix3bz9COev72Bs1g02\">Reference extras</a> include all fourteen download parts with source clips, alternate edits and unapproved mascot material.</p><p>These are design and creative review assets. The five interactive Claude Design ebooks are still being completed and will follow separately. The earlier text proof PDFs are superseded and are not the designed book collection.</p></div>",
